  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased use of monitoring and evaluation information for RBM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ILO-Regional Office for the Arab States is fostering its collaboration with other UN agencies to promote decent work at the regional level. This collaborative approach enables the sharing of knowledge, resources, and best practices, facilitating the creation and implementation of policies that advocate for decent work, non-discrimination and equal opportunities for all. Through these partnerships, the ILO not only champions the rights of workers but also supports economic development, proving that social justice and economic efficiency can go hand in hand. This strategy of cooperation and unity among various actors underscores the ILO&apos;s commitment to making decent work a regional reality.</narrative>
  </description>
